te":"2026-10-19","zh":"貝萊德 (BlackRock) 和安聯 (Allianz) 加入 Jio 8.54 億美元 IPO 的主力訂單簿"},{"title":"How BlackRock Clinic Deal At Humana (HUM) Has Changed Its Investment Story","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"BlackRock Clinic 與 Humana (HUM) 的交易如何改變其投資故事"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"自駕/機器人","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2012383/000119312526071966/blk-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"BlackRock, Inc. (together, with its subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise indicates, \"BlackRock\" or the \"Company\") is a leading publicly traded investment management firm with $14.0 trillion of assets under management (\"AUM\") at December 31, 2025. With approximately 24,900 employees in more than 30 countries who serve clients in over 100 countries across the globe, BlackRock provides a broad range of investment management and technology and subscription services to institutional and retail clients worldwide. On July 1, 2025, BlackRock completed the acquisition of 100% of the business and assets of HPS Investment Partners (the \"HPS Transaction\" or \"HPS\"), a leading global credit investment manager, with substantially all consideration paid in Class B-2 common units (\"Subco Units\") of BlackRock Saturn Subco, LLC (\"Subco\"), a consolidated subsidiary of the Company. Concurrent with the ","zh":"BlackRock, Inc.（除非文中另有說明，否則統稱「貝萊德」或「公司」）是一家領先的上市投資管理公司，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，其管理資產（「AUM」）為 14 兆美元。貝萊德在 30 多個國家/地區擁有約 24,900 名員工，為全球 100 多個國家的客戶提供服務，為機構和機構提供廣泛的投資管理、技術和訂閱服務。全球零售客户。 2025 年 7 月 1 日，貝萊德完成了對全球領先信貸投資管理公司 HPS Investment Partners 100% 的業務和資產的收購（「HPS 交易」或「HPS」），幾乎所有對價均以公司合併子公司 BlackRock Saturn Subco, LLC（「Subco」）的 B-2 類普通單位（Subcoco 單位）支付。與"},{"en":"BlackRock's diverse platform of alpha-seeking active, private markets, index and cash management investment strategies across asset classes enables the Company to offer choice and tailor investment and asset allocation solutions for clients. Product offerings include single- and multi-asset portfolios investing in equities, fixed income, private markets, liquid alternatives, digital assets, currencies and commodities, and money market instruments. Products are offered directly and through intermediaries in a variety of vehicles, including open-end and closed-end mutual funds, iShares exchange-traded funds (\"ETFs\"), separate accounts, collective trust funds and other pooled investment vehicles. BlackRock also offers technology and subscription services, including the investment and risk management technology platform, Aladdin , Aladdin WealthTM, eFront , Preqin, and Cachematrix , as well ","zh":"貝萊德跨資產類別的尋求阿爾法主動、私人市場、指數和現金管理投資策略的多元化平台使公司能夠為客戶提供選擇和客製化投資和資產配置解決方案。產品包括投資於股票、固定收益、私募市場、流動性另類投資、數位資產、貨幣和大宗商品以及貨幣市場工具的單一資產和多元資產投資組合。產品透過多種工具直接或透過中介機構提供，包括開放式和封閉式共同基金、iShares 交易所交易基金（「ETF」）、獨立帳戶、集體信託基金和其他集合投資工具。貝萊德也提供技術和訂閱服務，包括投資和風險管理技術平台 Aladdin 、 Aladdin WealthTM 、 eFront 、 Preqin 和 Cachematrix 。"},{"en":"BlackRock serves a diverse mix of institutional and retail clients across the globe. Clients include tax-exempt institutions, such as defined benefit and defined contribution pension plans, charities, foundations and endowments; official institutions, such as central banks, sovereign wealth funds, supranationals and other government entities; taxable institutions, including insurance companies, financial institutions, corporations and third-party fund sponsors, and retail intermediaries.","zh":"貝萊德為全球各類機構及零售客戶提供服務。客戶包括免稅機構，例如固定福利和固定繳款退休金計畫、慈善機構、基金會和捐贈基金；官方機構，例如中央銀行、主權財富基金、跨國組織和其他政府實體；應稅機構，包括保險公司、金融機構、企業和第三方基金發起人以及零售中介機構。"}],"markets":[{"en":"(1)Beginning in the first quarter of 2025, BlackRock updated the presentation of the Company's AUM line items. Such line items have been reclassified for prior periods to conform to this new presentation.","zh":"(1)從2025年第一季開始，貝萊德更新了公司資產管理規模專案的列報。先前期間的此類行項目已重新分類，以符合此新的列報。"},{"en":"(2)Beginning in the first quarter of 2025, BlackRock updated the presentation of net flows to separately disclose realizations, which represent return of capital/return on investments. Realizations in prior periods have not been recast.","zh":"(2)從2025年第一季開始，貝萊德更新了淨流量的列報，單獨揭露變現，即資本回報/投資回報。前期的實現並未被重鑄。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"BlackRock competes with investment management firms, mutual fund complexes, insurance companies, banks, brokerage firms, financial technology providers and other financial institutions that offer products that are similar to, or alternatives to, those offered by BlackRock. In order to grow its business, BlackRock must be able to compete effectively for AUM. Key competitive factors include investment performance track records, the efficient delivery of beta for index products, investment style and discipline, price, client service and brand name recognition. Historically, the Company has competed principally on the basis of its long-term investment performance track record, its investment process, its risk management and analytic capabilities and the quality of its client service.","zh":"貝萊德與投資管理公司、共同基金綜合體、保險公司、銀行、經紀公司、金融科技提供者和其他提供與貝萊德產品類似或替代產品的金融機構競爭。為了發展業務，貝萊德必須能夠有效競爭資產管理規模。主要競爭因素包括投資業績記錄、指數產品貝塔係數的有效交付、投資風格和紀律、價格、客戶服務和品牌知名度。從歷史上看，該公司的競爭主要基於其長期投資業績記錄、投資流程、風險管理和分析能力以及客戶服務品質。"},{"en":"With approximately 24,900 employees in more than 30 countries as of December 31, 2025, BlackRock provides a broad range of investment management and technology services to institutional and retail clients in more than 100 countries across the globe. As an asset manager, BlackRock's long-term success depends on its people and how it manages its workforce.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，貝萊德在30多個國家擁有約24,900名員工，為全球100多個國家的機構和零售客戶提供廣泛的投資管理和技術服務。作為一家資產管理公司，貝萊德的長期成功取決於其員工及其管理員工的方式。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Investment Advice","val":19179000000,"zh":"投資建議"},{"name":"Revenue By Client Type","val":19179000000,"zh":"按客戶類型劃分的收入"},{"name":"Revenue By Investment Style","val":19179000000,"zh":"按投資方式劃分的收入"},{"name":"Technology Services & Subscription Revenue","val":1981000000,"zh":"技術服務和訂閱收入"},{"name":"Investment Performance","val":1424000000,"zh":"Investment Performance"},{"name":"Distribution & Shareholder Service","val":1355000000,"zh":"分銷及股東服務"},{"name":"Service Other","val":277000000,"zh":"服務其他"}],"total":24216000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":15956000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"Europe","val":7166000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1094000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":24216000000}},"peers":["BX","MS","GS","SCHW","MA"]}}